# Local override (sandbox fixture)

Gitignored tier: machine- or worktree-specific tweaks that beat every other
memory layer. In production you would NOT commit this file — the repo's own
.gitignore already excludes CLAUDE.local.md; here it exists to prove local
specificity wins during resolution.

## Overrides for this checkout only

- Use port 8123 for any dev server started in this worktree.
- Treat ./scratch/** as disposable; never stage it in commits.
- During demos, narrate each mechanism out loud before running commands.
